  <!-- EN: Ambrosia Nectar, known by a number of different names including 'nectar of the gods' by tribal societies, is a unique and extremely potent alcoholic beverage.  Utterly addictive, once someone has tasted this heavenly drink, nothing ever quite tastes or feels the same again.  Those inebriated by it feel happy and fuzzy, but are about as useful as a drunken sot while inebriated. -->
  <RC2_AmbrosiaNectar.description>Ambrosia Nectar 有许多不同的名字，包括部落社会中的 "众神之蜜"，它是一种独特且极其烈性的酒精饮料。  它极易上瘾，一旦有人品尝过这种天堂般的饮料，就再也不会有相同的味道和感觉了。  被它迷醉的人感到快乐和模糊，但就像一个喝醉酒的傻子一样，在醉酒后无所事事。</RC2_AmbrosiaNectar.description>
